      "text": "The trip record carries the driver's arrival event - 'I'm Here' tapped at 2026-08-24T10:06:17 - and the GPS trace independently places him inside the STANDARD arrival radius of 50 m from the first qualifying in-geofence fix, which is timestamped 10:06:17, a dwell_start_offset of 0.0 s. Limbs (a) and (b) of POL-NS-01 are therefore satisfied on the platform's own telemetry, the arrival marker and the geofence entry coinciding to the second.",
