      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-01", "POL-NS-02"],
      "relies_on": "derived.arrival.dwell_start_offset_sec",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The driver then held position inside that geofence for a continuous 420 seconds - 44 qualifying fixes running unbroken from 10:06:17 to 10:13:17 - against a free waiting period of 180 seconds in force for this trip and a null no_show_threshold_sec, so no longer threshold cuts the dwell down. POL-NS-01(c) is met with 240 seconds to spare, and the shortfall computed on this trace is minus 240 seconds, not a shortfall at all.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-02715", "EV-TRIP-02715"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-01", "POL-NS-06"],
      "relies_on": "derived.arrival.longest_qualifying_run.duration_sec",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The trace on which the arrival test is run is unimpaired: 100.0% coverage, a 10-second sample interval against a 10-second expected interval, 84 driver fixes, no gaps recorded and a maximum gap of 0.0 seconds, with 44 fixes inside the 50 m radius. POL-NS-02's three-consecutive-fix test is met many times over, and nothing approaches the 120-second gap that POL-NS-08(b) treats as a policy-level impairment, so there is no basis to discount the arrival or the dwell.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-02715"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-02", "POL-NS-08"],
      "relies_on": "derived.arrival.qualifying_fix_count",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The trip was terminated by the driver at 10:13:19 - 422 seconds after the first qualifying in-geofence fix - under reason code RIDER_NO_SHOW, one of the three codes POL-NS-01(d) recognises, and the record shows no boarding event and a null started_at. Limb (d) is satisfied: the cancellation falls after the required dwell had already elapsed.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-TRIP-02715"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-01"],
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "No false-arrival case arises under POL-NS-05: the derived arrival facts put the driver inside the 50 m radius at the arrival timestamp itself, so he was nowhere near the 300 m distance trigger, and what follows is a single continuous in-geofence dwell rather than a vehicle still in motion. The marker is true and the waiting clock needs no recomputation.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-TRIP-02715", "EV-GPS-02715"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-05", "POL-NS-01"],
      "relies_on": "derived.arrival.dwell_start_offset_sec",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "With POL-NS-01 satisfied in full, POL-NS-07 fixes the driver's payout at 80 percent of the SGD 4.50 fee in force - SGD 3.60 - the same figure the fare ledger derives. The anti-farming check does not trip, and only the two counters the clause permits may be used: no_show_terminations_30d is 1, below the absolute limb of 4, and 1 against 134 completed_trips_30d is a rate of 0.007, below the 0.08 limb. Both limbs must hold together and neither does.",
