      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-07", "POL-GEN-01"],
      "relies_on": "derived.money.driver_compensation",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "EV-ADVIS-02715-01 is MISSING - no advisory covers this pickup - and I disclose it as impaired rather than present it as clean: weight 0.0, issue code MISSING_ARTIFACT. The driver relies on it only as the absence it is, and it decides nothing, because he never left the geofence: the dwell is one unbroken 420-second in-geofence interval, so the accumulation limb of POL-NS-06(i) has nothing to add and the driver does not assert it against a MISSING artifact.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-ADVIS-02715-01", "EV-GPS-02715"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-06", "POL-GEN-02"],
      "asserted_weight": 0.0
    },
    {
      "text": "No POL-NS-09 escalation trigger is engaged on this record: the admissible artifacts do not contradict each other on arrival, dwell or rider presence; the same-party dispute counters read 0 and 0, under the 2 that limb (c) requires; rider_profile.no_show_disputes_30d is 0 against the 3 limb (d) names, and the POL-NS-07 anti-farming check is clean; and the deciding facts rest on complete artifacts carrying weight 1.0, so limb (e) is not reached. This case is decidable on the money, not for a reviewer.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-RPROF-02715", "EV-DPROF-02715", "EV-GPS-02715"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-09"],
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "I do not contest the coordination facts, and the driver advances no coordination defence he cannot support: the chat log shows two locating messages from the rider, at 10:06:47 and 10:08:47, both delivered and neither read, the record shows no reply from the driver and an empty in_app_calls list, and the rider's track keeps his device within 20.9 m of the pin. On that record all three limbs of POL-NS-04 are made out, and I say so rather than stretch the point; the driver's claims above stand on their own evidence as to arrival, dwell, reason code and compensation.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-CHAT-02715", "EV-GPS-02715", "EV-TRIP-02715"],
