    "explanation": "Outcome: the SGD 4.50 no-show cancellation fee charged on TRP-02715 is refunded to the rider in full, and no driver compensation is payable.\n\nTo the driver: your arrival case under POL-NS-01 is made out on the instruments, and I do not doubt your statement that you waited. The trip record shows the 'I'm Here' event at 10:06:17, the GPS trace places you inside the 50 m STANDARD arrival radius from 10:06:17 with a continuous 420-second in-geofence dwell (44 qualifying fixes, 10:06:17 to 10:13:17) against the 180-second free waiting period in force, and the trip was terminated at 10:13:19 under RIDER_NO_SHOW with no boarding event and a null started_at. On those facts alone the fee would stand and POL-NS-07 would pay you SGD 3.60, 80% of the SGD 4.50 net fee.\n\nPOL-NS-04 displaces that outcome, and it does so on the evidence and on your own side's concession of the coordination facts. Its three limbs all hold. (a) The rider sent locating messages inside the waiting window: 'im at the pickup, which car are you? i cant see you' at 10:06:47 and 'hello? are you here' at 10:08:47, both delivered, both with read_at null. (b) You neither replied in the chat within 120 seconds of either message nor placed an in-app call: the chat log holds no message from you and trip_record.in_app_calls is an empty array, and you cancelled 6 min 32 s after the first message and 4 min 32 s after the second. (c) The rider's device stayed inside the 100 m rider presence radius for a STANDARD zone for all 67 of its qualifying fixes, none filtered, at a maximum distance of 20.89 m from the pin (mean 17.66 m). POL-NS-04 therefore exonerates the rider and refunds the fee in full; POL-NS-07's payout cannot arise, because it is conditioned on no clause from POL-NS-03 to POL-NS-06 displacing POL-NS-01, and POL-NS-04 does displace it. Waiting is not the test POL-NS-04 sets.\n\nPOL-NS-05 neither helps nor hurts you: the arrival marker was true, since you were inside the 50 m radius at 10:06:17 and nowhere near the 300 m or 15 km/h triggers, so no false-arrival referral arises and the waiting clock needs no recomputation.\n\nMoney and evidence weight. The contested and charged figure is SGD 4.50 (fare_breakdown cancellation_fee 4.50, total_charged 4.50, payment_status CHARGED, refund_issued_sgd 0.00), and that whole amount is returned. The ruling rests on EV-GPS-02715, EV-CHAT-02715 and EV-TRIP-02715, each COMPLETE at weight 1.0, with EV-FARE-02715 at 1.0 for the figure, so the POL-GEN-02(2) cap is 1.0 and the ruling issues at 0.95. EV-ADVIS-02715-01 is MISSING at weight 0.0 with issue MISSING_ARTIFACT; it is disclosed, it carries no fact, and it makes the accumulation limb POL-NS-06(i) unavailable rather than exonerating anyone - the dwell is a single unbroken 420-second interval with nothing to sum.\n\nPOL-NS-09 is not engaged: no admissible artifacts contradict one another on arrival, dwell or rider presence; the same-pair dispute counters are 0 and 0; rider_profile.no_show_disputes_30d is 0; and the POL-NS-07 anti-farming check is clean at 1 no-show termination in 30 days against 134 completed trips (rate 0.007). No clause on these facts produces a referral, so the referrals list is empty. The monetary effect, SGD 4.50, is below the POL-GEN-05 execution threshold of SGD 8.00, so the refund executes automatically on issue; this is a provisional ruling and either party may appeal under POL-GEN-04."
  },
  "discarded_claims": []
}

